(out/'README.md').write_text("# Correct the frame contract's append description\n\nMethod A: one complete original378B body, shared reviewed role adapter actually\ninvoked. Producer valid; independent review and canonical correction pending.\nEXE73461d0896204b1c259c52f61aef4efbc95a2ffc388cadb36493d5d1d89721f8,\nimagebase120000. Full L1+L2 goal remains ACTIVE/NOT_MET.\n\nPlayer version: this routine cleans resources out of a release list; it does\nnot build or add a new resource. The existing frame contract had that backwards.\nIts normal zero return also does not mean all outstanding file reads finished.\n\nOriginal2E6900 walks the sweep list to its tail, services requested AND loaded\nlanes, clears their handles/masks and unlinks nodes. Mode0 stops the first\nreverse walk after one node; nonzero continues. Its later pass calls2E6A80 on\nnegative node indices. Direct head writes preserve the head or clear it when\nthe removed node was that head; opaque callee effects remain separate.\n\nEvery normal return is dominated by2E6A70 XOR EAX,EAX; the exact epilogue has\nno EAX write or bypass. This is a complete local return proof, not sampled\nreturn values, proof of progress, global IO drain or actual gameplay scheduling.\n\nconsumer01 pins the exact original page bytes/paragraphs. The current2E6900\nlist-append/build/tail-insert wording needs owner repair. The2E6A80 no-flags\nwording requires exact loaded24|mask28, independently established by the\nretained lane proof pending its own review; pending34 is not in that test.\n\nReproduce in a writable copy within this repo with the verified original EXE\nand fresh outputs. Three actual CLI controls reuse positive01 and refuse\nfailed capture, a coherent same-count changed EAX return definition and missing\nconsumer evidence; refusal produces no result. Counts are not acceptance.\n\nValid list/state, normal ABI/returns and no interference are premises.\nNontermination/exceptions are not normal returns. Opaque callees, allocator/IO\ncompletion and natural schedule are unproved. No peer page was edited.\nConsumers: OPUS owning frame contract repair; FABLE list/scheduling semantics;\nprior ASTRA return0 conditional may be narrowed only after independent verdict.\nNo game/PC/native/emulated execution or save/config/reference changes.\n",encoding='utf8')
members=[dict(path=p.relative_to(out).as_posix(),bytes=p.stat().st_size,sha256=sha(p)) for p in sorted(out.rglob('*')) if p.is_file()]
(out/'manifest.json').write_text(json.dumps(dict(status='FROZEN_PRODUCER_VALID_INDEPENDENT_PENDING',members=members,member_count=len(members),native_path_units=units,exe_sha256=r['exe_sha256'],method='A STATIC_ONLY',native_runs=0,live_runs=0,new_whole_runtime_rows_closed=0),indent=2)+'\n')
